[[Category:Tmp_xyobj(neg)]]

The moose or elk, is the largest and heaviest extant species in the Deer family. They are notorious for their extreme size and strength, as well as their intimidating intelligence, as moose are known to attempt to drown their victims, and short of that will try to crush their ribcage and lungs.

=Combat=

==Behaviour==
Moose are aggressive and have a decent chance to [[execute]] you if they KO you.

